40514050/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4140592673","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117847#issuecomment-4140592673","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117847","id":4140592673,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc72zG4h","user":{"login":"MewPurPur","id":85438892,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NDM4ODky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85438892?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur","html_url":"https://github.com/MewPurPur","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-27T06:54:48Z","updated_at":"2026-03-27T12:24:40Z","body":"No opinions here, I think all options except for the rocketship one (way too small and unreadable) and CryptoKey (too rugged for such a simple thing) are good. Including the current icon.\r\n\r\nEdit: Nevermind, not on board with the \"kw\" class of things either, it really clashes with the aesthetic of classes and would be confusing.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4140592673/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4141023229","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117847#issuecomment-4141023229","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117847","id":4141023229,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc720v_9","user":{"login":"AdriaandeJongh","id":5611323,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MTEzMjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5611323?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh","html_url":"https://github.com/AdriaandeJongh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-27T08:39:09Z","updated_at":"2026-03-27T08:39:09Z","body":"Funnily enough I didn't read the OP well and scrolled to the images, and as a non-native English speaker, I was immediately super confused why `return` had an icon in front of it with 'KW'. My thinking was \"what the heck does KW mean?!\" and I never associated that autocomplete with it being a keyword. \r\n\r\n`return` being a keyword – or any other symbol being a keyword, for that matter – is a very technical point of view that requires intimate knowledge of language parsing which 95% of Godot users don't have. I also think the icon for return is in particular different than VAR because variables actually start with `var` so the connection is immediate and clear.\r\n\r\nPerhaps, if we want the icon in front of return to have text, RET would make more sense as the icon in front of return? Otherwise, why not use the universal 'return' icon that's on everyone's keyboards?\r\n\r\nI guess I am also suggesting not to introduce an icon for keywords, but to have clear and specific icons for the few keywords that autocomplete. Because users, they would be looking for the `return` autocomplete option – not for a keyword.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4141023229/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4141756183","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117847#issuecomment-4141756183","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117847","id":4141756183,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc723i8X","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-27T10:50:40Z","updated_at":"2026-03-27T10:50:40Z","body":"I think having a shorthand text for \"keyword\" in the icon is missing the point, of having a dedicated icon.\r\n\r\nKeywords should be visually distinguishable from classes. We don't need text for that.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4141756183/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4142262934","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117847#issuecomment-4142262934","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117847","id":4142262934,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc725eqW","user":{"login":"Nolkaloid","id":30960698,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwOTYwNjk4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30960698?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nolkaloid","html_url":"https://github.com/Nolkaloid","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nolkaloid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nolkaloid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nolkaloid/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nolkaloid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nolkaloid/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nolkaloid/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nolkaloid/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nolkaloid/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nolkaloid/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-27T12:32:33Z","updated_at":"2026-03-27T12:53:13Z","body":"When I learned programing, I learned that some words like \"if\", \"else\" \"return\", \"for\" etc. are special... keywords, that are part of the syntax of the language. I'd argue that most people that are familiar with programming know that those are \"keywords\". But it's true that \"kw\" can be unclear especially if you're not an english speaker.\r\n\r\nAssociating a icon with each type of keyword could be a good idea. But I'm worried that it would get too cluttered, because we would need an icon for `class` `func`, `var`, all control flow instructions... and would end up more confusing than anything. And It seems to me that in other code editors all those are grouped under the same thing.\r\n\r\nI can see why people aren't fond of the text version, and I'm fine with the :rocket:  variant. I don't think it's \"rugged\", and it somehow matches the VS counterpart. **Therefore I changed it to this version.**\r\n\r\n@dalexeev I thought of that at first but then I realized it could be bit confusing because a key may denotes more something of a key-value semantic. \r\n\r\nBut here is a variant using the key, let me know what you think:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"438\" height=\"72\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/13bde44e-7d7e-49b9-84ef-52be1592820c\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4142262934/reactions","total_count":7,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":5,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4174532458","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117847#issuecomment-4174532458","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117847","id":4174532458,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc740k9q","user":{"login":"AdriaandeJongh","id":5611323,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MTEzMjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5611323?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh","html_url":"https://github.com/AdriaandeJongh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-02T04:19:01Z","updated_at":"2026-04-02T04:19:01Z","body":"> Keywords should be visually distinguishable from classes. We don't need text for that.\r\n\r\nagreed. latest icon seems fine to me, regarding that. i believe the pr still updating to that icon?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4174532458/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4179100119","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117847#issuecomment-4179100119","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117847","id":4179100119,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc75GAHX","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-02T16:41:12Z","updated_at":"2026-04-02T16:43:19Z","body":"I'm personally not a fan of the key metaphor here. It's relevant to keep in mind, that the same spot can contain arbitrary icons of native classes which might use the key metaphor in an unrelated way. So a strong association with \"code\" is more important than an association with \"key\" IMO.\r\n\r\nE.g. while our icon for it is different, my first association for this icon was \"Certificate\" or \"signing key\".","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4179100119/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4179162821","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117847#issuecomment-4179162821","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117847","id":4179162821,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc75GPbF","user":{"login":"Nolkaloid","id":30960698,"node_i